  "reference": "Mwandzo 33",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "33",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "33",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo watsupha matso achimuona Esau aredza na alume magana mane. Phahi, waganya achee na anae makundi mane, chila mchetu na anae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaika hara atumishi a chichetu na ana aho mbere, halafu Lea na anae, mwisho achimuika Raheli na Yusufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo mwenye watanguliya mbere zao, achisujudu kano sabaa kuno anamsengerera nduguye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Esau achizola kpwedzamchinjira, achimtiya chifuwani na achimdonera; chisha osi achirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau ariphotsupha matso na kuona hara achetu na ana ao, waamba, “Hano urio nao ni ano ani?” Jakobo achiamba, “Hano ni ana ambao Mlungu wanipha mimi mtumishio kpwa mbazize.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho hara anachetu na ana aho asengera na achimgbwerera maguluni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Lea na anae, nao akpwedza achimgbwerera maguluni. Mwisho, Yusufu na nine Raheli, nao akpwedza piya achimgbwerera maguluni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Esau achiuza, “Hira mifugo nchiyoiona kura njirani ni yaani?” Jakobo achiamba, “Bwana, ni zawadizo ili ukubali kunikaribisha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Esau achiamba, “Nina mali ya kutosha mwenehu, maliyo naikale yako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo achiamba, “Tafadhali bwana, nakuvoya! Ichikala kpweli ukanikubali, phahi phokera zawadi zangu nikuphazo. Kuona usoo ni kama kuona uso wa Mlungu, mana ukaniphokera vinono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuvoya uphokere zawadi chizokurehera, mana Mlungu wanionera mbazi na achinipha chila chitu nilondacho.” Jakobo waenderera kumshurutisha Esau hadi achikubali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau achiamba, “Haya, nahuphiyeni; hundaphiyani phamwenga, mino nindakala mbere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jakobo achimuamba, “Bwana wangu, unamanya kukala anache taana nguvu, na ni lazima nimanyirire higa mangʼondzi na ngʼombe ambazo zinaamwisa. Ichikala hino mifugo indatsungbwa mairo kpwa mairo, hata kpwa siku mwenga tu, phahi, mifugo indafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, nakuvoya bwana wangu, utanguliye nami nredza pore-pore, mwendo wa hano anache na hino mifugo hadi hufike kpwako hiko Seiri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau achiamba, “Phahi nkurichire atu angu anjina akuterye.” Ela Jakobo achiamba, “Taina haja bwana wangu, vyo uchivyonionera mbazi, vinatosha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi siku iyo-iyo Esau wagbwira njira achiuya Seiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo ariphofika Sukothi wadzidzengera nyumba na vibanda vya mifugoye. Ndiyo mana phatu hipho phaihwa Sukothi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sukothi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kpwa Chieburania manage ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "vibanda.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwisho wa charoche, kula Padani-Aramu hadi tsi ya Kanani, Jakobo wafika salama mudzi wa Shekemu; achichita kambiye kondze chidide ya mudzi hinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.24.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 24:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 4:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo wagula hira seemu yokala akachita hemare kula kpwa ana a Hamori, ise wa Shekemu na vipande gana mwenga vya feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadzenga phatu pha kulavira sadaka pho hipho na achiphaiha Eli-Elohe-Iziraeli, manaye ni “Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
